    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On September 14, 2020 the Institute for Global Health and Development hosted its inaugural webinar on the topic of Climate Change, Health, and Development. There was international interest for this webinar with over 300 registrants from across the globe. Speakers and panelists represented multiple organizations and shed light on topics related to climate change and health within their unique contexts.",
